get.description:
Returns metadata about the authenticated key including plan, credits, org, and last-used info.
Credits are the POOL's when this is a team key (its own counter is never charged);
`team` describes the pool on accounts that hold or may hold team keys.

post.description:
Cost: 0 credits. Returns the same 30-day console session that the emailed link mints;
present `session_token` in the X-API-Key header exactly like a key. The failure reply is
identical whether the address is unknown, has no password yet, or the password is wrong.
